# Local build prefixes — never commit, never sweep with `git stash -u`.
# Lives inside the repo so deps travel with `mv` operations and never end
# up orphaned. dev-build.sh's DEPS_CANDIDATES (candidates 3 and 4) finds
# this layout; the legacy sibling layout `../BambuStudio_dep/` is also
# supported but we prefer in-repo so the build is self-contained.
deps_build/
# Defensive: catch the legacy sibling layout if someone ever places it
# inside the repo by mistake (it shouldn't be tracked there either).
BambuStudio_dep/
.claude/
